    "description": "This dataset contains water temperature, salinity, nutrients, plankton, currents, and others taken by CTD, ADCP, and other instrumentation from research vessel Dong Fang Hong in the North Pacific Ocean from 2017-10-17 to 2017-12-07. The field campaign was aimed to observe water mass, nutrients, and biogeochemical cycling variation in the island arc area of Western Pacific under global warming. This field campaign  was originally planned in jurisdictional sea of USA from 2017-09-01 through 2017-11-30. Actual entry and departure dates are 2017-10-17 and 2017-12-07, respectively. These data are submitted as part of the World Data Service for Oceanography hosted at NCEI, MSR cruise U2017-009. Data are in text and XLS formats.",
